{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾君，今天一定要好好加油！」", "text_idx": 249, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "mu1465", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好，這次我會善用舌頭的！」", "text_idx": 239, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 310, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸……」", "text_idx": 254, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "mu1466", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我會努力成為結子小姐認可的男人！」", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 310, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……那個，我是說念書。」", "text_idx": 203, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "mu1467", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊啊，說的也是！沒有人說是要努力接吻嘛！」", "text_idx": 225, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 310, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在踏進學姊家之前，我就已經慌張到手足無措了。", "text_idx": 286, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我只是去學姊家念書準備期末考而已。", "text_idx": 302, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "忘掉吧，把接吻的事忘得一乾二淨吧。", "text_idx": 299, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 194, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 310, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 194, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "mu1468", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "翻開英文教科書後，已經過了３０分鐘。", "text_idx": 327, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "沒有結子小姐的妨礙，我本以為複習應該會有所進展。", "text_idx": 313, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那個，美羽學姊。」", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 310, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊、是的！」", "text_idx": 224, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "mu1469", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 194, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 310, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 194, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "mu1470", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一對上眼神，我們就同時低下頭。一直重複這個循環。", "text_idx": 278, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「感、感覺好熱喔～」", "text_idx": 242, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 310, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔、嗯，說的也是呢～」", "text_idx": 221, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "mu1471", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 194, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 310, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 194, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "mu1472", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "好尷尬。", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而且也念不下書。", "text_idx": 328, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就這樣忍耐下去也不是辦法。", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「美羽學姊，那個……」", "text_idx": 260, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 310, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……嗯。」", "text_idx": 196, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "mu1473", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "學姊似乎也在想同一件事，她主動把自己的臉靠近。", "text_idx": 291, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「抱歉喔，明明應該念書才行的……」", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "mu1474", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我才要說對不起。從剛才就一直在想奇怪的事情……」", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 310, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「奇怪的事情？」", "text_idx": 236, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "mu1475", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那個……我，想跟美羽學姊接吻……」", "text_idx": 270, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 310, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 194, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "mu1476", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "學姊紅著臉點點頭。", "text_idx": 296, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "第一次的親吻就是讓我們感到如此衝擊。", "text_idx": 317, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "沒想到只是雙唇相貼，就能那麼舒服……", "text_idx": 312, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……媽媽說要善用舌頭對吧？」", "text_idx": 198, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "mu1477", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「要試試看嗎？」", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 310, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 194, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "mu1478", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "學姊再次點頭，我抬起她的下巴，首先把嘴唇貼上去。", "text_idx": 292, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然後抱住她的肩膀，一邊變換角度一邊伸出舌頭與她糾纏。", "text_idx": 314, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯、啾、咧溜、嗯嗯、啾、哈啊、啊姆、啾、咧囉、咧溜、嗯、啾……」", "text_idx": 230, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "mu1479", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一開始只是輕輕地戳，感受舌頭的動作。", "text_idx": 279, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "學姊的呼吸好熱。", "text_idx": 294, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "產生了一種身體輕飄飄浮起的錯覺。", "text_idx": 315, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啾、嗯嗯、啊姆、咧嚕、嗯、啾、咧囉、啾、嗯嗯、啾……」", "text_idx": 229, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "mu1480", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我試著順勢吸吮學姊的舌頭，她立刻抖了一下。", "text_idx": 307, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊姆、啾、啾、哈姆、啾、啾……」", "text_idx": 226, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "mu1481", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "接著學姊也開始吸我的舌頭，這次換我抖了一下。", "text_idx": 308, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哈啊，新吾君……」", "text_idx": 220, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "mu1482", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯、啾、啊姆、咧嚕、咧囉、啾、嗯嗯、啾、咧嚕、啾……」", "text_idx": 231, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "mu1483", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "學姊的舌頭伸得比我更長，糾纏的動作也更流暢。", "text_idx": 295, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看來她比我更早掌握到訣竅，非常積極地使用舌頭。", "text_idx": 316, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "糾纏吸吮、吸吮又糾纏，好像一個不注意自己就要被她壓倒了。", "text_idx": 318, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哈啊哈啊、學姊……」", "text_idx": 219, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 310, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啾……嗯……有善用舌頭了嗎……」", "text_idx": 227, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "mu1484", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啾、啾、嗯、哈啊……啾、啾……新吾君你都愣住了……」", "text_idx": 228, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "mu1485", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "最後，學姊用力吸吮了一下我的舌頭，面帶笑容地玩弄著我。", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我覺得今天越來越沒辦法念書了。", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我想一整天都跟學姊接吻。", "text_idx": 303, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……這下子，要念書是不可能的了呢。」", "text_idx": 202, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "mu1486", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「美羽老師太殘酷了。」", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 310, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「怎麼辦？明明今天下午要打工沒有時間……」", "text_idx": 241, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "mu1487", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那就努力到打工時間為止吧。」", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 310, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「英文嗎？」", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "mu1488", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不，是接吻。」", "text_idx": 208, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 310, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 194, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "mu1489", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我的指尖撫摸著害羞不已的學姊的唇，兩人凝視著彼此。", "text_idx": 305, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "接著學姊將我的食指含入口中，輕輕點頭。", "text_idx": 309, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾君……嗯嗯！？啾、嗯嗯、啾、嗯嗯、啾、啾、嗯嗯嗯！？」", "text_idx": 248, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "mu1490", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在這之後，我跟美羽老師的秘密讀書會沒有停歇地持續下去……", "text_idx": 287, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……新吾同學，你怎麼了嗎？」", "text_idx": 200, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "結子", "alt_speaker_idx": 319, "voice": "yk0116", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸？」", "text_idx": 255, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 310, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你從剛才開始就很疲倦的樣子……」", "text_idx": 211, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "結子", "alt_speaker_idx": 319, "voice": "yk0117", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊、不……」", "text_idx": 223, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 310, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "美羽學姊出門去打工，我正要回家的時候被結子小姐留下來喝茶。", "text_idx": 326, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我無法思考。", "text_idx": 304, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "結果，直到學姊去打工前我們都在接吻。", "text_idx": 323, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就連現在，我都感覺有東西貼在嘴唇上。", "text_idx": 298, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而且，看到與美羽學姊相似的結子小姐的嘴唇心臟猛跳了一下。", "text_idx": 330, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「念書有進展了嗎？」", "text_idx": 240, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "結子", "alt_speaker_idx": 319, "voice": "yk0118", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呃，嗯……」", "text_idx": 218, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 310, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "其實我們一直在親親這件事我說不出口。", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而且結子小姐身上的香氣好甜我不敢靠近。", "text_idx": 329, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她看起來一點也不像人妻。就算穿上結女的制服去學校也沒有違和感……", "text_idx": 288, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這樣啊。我還以為你們一定是在房間裡練習接吻了呢……」", "text_idx": 267, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "結子", "alt_speaker_idx": 319, "voice": "yk0119", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「噗！？」", "text_idx": 234, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 310, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那孩子從昨天晚上就一直嚷嚷著。」", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "結子", "alt_speaker_idx": 319, "voice": "yk0120", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「她說自己年紀比較大，所以必須比新吾同學更擅長接吻才行。」", "text_idx": 238, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "結子", "alt_speaker_idx": 319, "voice": "yk0121", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「還希望我教她接吻的方法……」", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "結子", "alt_speaker_idx": 319, "voice": "yk0122", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那個……所以結子小姐就教她了嗎？」", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 310, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔呼呼，這個嘛，你覺得呢？」", "text_idx": 222, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "結子", "alt_speaker_idx": 319, "voice": "yk0123", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "唔哇，她絕對教了。", "text_idx": 285, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "原來如此，是結子小姐親授的接吻啊……", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一回想起來，嘴唇就覺得寂寞了。", "text_idx": 277, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不過，感覺真好呢。可以聊這種事情的親子關係……」", "text_idx": 206, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 310, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是嗎？」", "text_idx": 252, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "結子", "alt_speaker_idx": 319, "voice": "yk0124", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是的。明明是母女卻像朋友一樣，讓我很憧憬。」", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 310, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "如果結子小姐是我媽媽的話，我感覺自己一定會變成最強的戀母情結。", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "誰都不准碰我媽媽！之類的。", "text_idx": 332, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……但是，身為母親我是失職了。」", "text_idx": 195, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "結子", "alt_speaker_idx": 319, "voice": "yk0125", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸？」", "text_idx": 255, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 310, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "聽到意料之外的話，椅子喀搭了一下。", "text_idx": 331, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因為我沒辦法治好美羽內心的傷口……」", "text_idx": 235, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "結子", "alt_speaker_idx": 319, "voice": "yk0126", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「內心的傷口……？」", "text_idx": 214, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 310, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "結子小姐輕輕撫摸著趴在她腿上的貓，轉頭看著我。", "text_idx": 322, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「美羽她其實是不能養動物的孩子。」", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "結子", "alt_speaker_idx": 319, "voice": "yk0127", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不能養動物是什麼意思？她有過敏之類的嗎……？」", "text_idx": 205, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 310, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不，不是那種原因。」", "text_idx": 207, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "結子", "alt_speaker_idx": 319, "voice": "yk0128", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「她小時候家裡養的貓因為生病過世了……」", "text_idx": 237, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "結子", "alt_speaker_idx": 319, "voice": "yk0129", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那之後，她因為打擊太大，所以害怕再飼養動物。」", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "結子", "alt_speaker_idx": 319, "voice": "yk0130", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 194, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 310, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「明明知道這件事，我卻養了花鈴和朵萌……養了新的貓。」", "text_idx": 251, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "結子", "alt_speaker_idx": 319, "voice": "yk0131", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 113, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「可是，那樣……」", "text_idx": 217, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 310, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 114, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那孩子實在是太愛動物們了吧。」", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "結子", "alt_speaker_idx": 319, "voice": "yk0132", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 115, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以就算是自然衰老死亡，美羽也會歸咎到自己身上。」", "text_idx": 245, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "結子", "alt_speaker_idx": 319, "voice": "yk0133", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 116, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「總有一天，花鈴和朵萌死掉的時候一定也是……」", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "結子", "alt_speaker_idx": 319, "voice": "yk0134", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 117, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「讓女兒遭受這些事，我是個失職的母親。」", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "結子", "alt_speaker_idx": 319, "voice": "yk0135", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 118, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「沒有那種事喔。我覺得結子小姐是個很優秀的母親。」", "text_idx": 257, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 310, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 119, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 194, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "結子", "alt_speaker_idx": 319, "voice": "yk0136", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 120, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不是同情也不是客套話，我是真心這麼想。", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 121, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "貓咪們像是也贊同我的話，蹭了蹭結子小姐。", "text_idx": 333, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 122, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「謝謝你。今後美羽的事，就拜託你了。」", "text_idx": 265, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "結子", "alt_speaker_idx": 319, "voice": "yk0137", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 123, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "美羽學姊一定也是這麼想的。", "text_idx": 325, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 124, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "露出這個笑容的結子小姐，是最棒也是最優秀的母親──", "text_idx": 335, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 125, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你沒有被媽媽做什麼奇怪的事情吧？」", "text_idx": 212, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "mu1491", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 126, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「沒事啦。比起那個，今天請妳好好休息。」", "text_idx": 256, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 310, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 127, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 194, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "mu1492", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 128, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "學姊很不捨得分開地握住我的手。", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 129, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "結子小姐說的那些事，我決定不要告訴學姊。", "text_idx": 321, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 130, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我不想讓學姊想起過世的貓，也希望她能一直保持笑容。", "text_idx": 300, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 131, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「抱歉喔，結果今天還是沒能念書……」", "text_idx": 247, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "mu1493", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 132, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不會，因為是我的錯。」", "text_idx": 204, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 310, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 133, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是我……一直在跟新吾君親親……」", "text_idx": 210, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "mu1494", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 134, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……現在也有點想。」", "text_idx": 201, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "mu1495", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 135, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「可以喔。」", "text_idx": 216, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 310, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 136, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯！？啾、嗯嗯、啾、哈啊、嗯、啾……」", "text_idx": 232, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "mu1496", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 137, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我們牽著手，忘我地接吻。", "text_idx": 301, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 138, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "跟結子小姐相同的氣味，沾附到我的身上。", "text_idx": 334, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 139, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……接吻，是這麼舒服的事情啊。」", "text_idx": 199, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "mu1497", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 140, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，舒服到有點可怕。」", "text_idx": 233, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 310, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 141, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 194, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "mu1498", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 142, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是……還有比接吻更舒服的事情對吧？」", "text_idx": 209, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "mu1499", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 143, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 194, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 310, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 144, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 194, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "mu1500", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 145, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「光是要想像就有點可怕呢……」", "text_idx": 213, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 310, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 146, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……嗯，沒辦法想像呢。比接吻還厲害的事……」", "text_idx": 197, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "mu1501", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 147, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不過總有一天，我們也會經歷那種事。", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 148, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "到時，我們會怎麼樣呢……果然無法想像。", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 149, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾君，可以再親一次嗎？」", "text_idx": 250, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "mu1502", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 150, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「別說一次，要幾次都可以。」", "text_idx": 215, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 310, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 151, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「聽到你這樣說，我真的會親很多很多次了。」", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "mu1503", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 152, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "結子小姐親授的接吻讓我徹底蕩漾，沉迷其中了……", "text_idx": 320, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
